In version 2.0, the Audio Intelligence Engine introduces:

** Smart Extraction: Replaced standard tools with yt-dlp and pytube-fix for more resilient data fetching, using Regular 
Expressions (RegEx) to sanitize and structure metadata at the source.
** Speaker & Noise Intelligence: Integrated OpenAI’s Whisper and Google Cloud Speech-to-Text to enable:
  - Speaker Diarization: Automatically identifying who said what in multi-person meetings.
  - Ambient Noise Filtering: Distinguishing between media speech and background noise to ensure high-fidelity transcripts 
even in "real-world" audio environments.
** Cloud Cost Optimization: Implemented Data Lifecycle Management in Google Cloud Storage (GCS) to address rising cloud 
storage fees. 
